<Positioned left="76.00" top="676.00" width="190.00" height="18.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="11.5" color="#5A6B78" fontFamily="Noto Sans Mono CJK SC" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">20 000–40 000 ft</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="260.00" top="648.00" width="340.00" height="40.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="11" color="#5A6B78" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">更宽范围：—（积雨云消散的卷云，冬季可远低于 6 km）</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="460.00" top="634.00" width="200.00" height="32.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="22" color="#1F2A33" fontFamily="Noto Serif CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">冰晶</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="460.00" top="668.00" width="260.00" height="32.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="10.5" color="#5A6B78" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">透明程度取决于冰晶的分离程度；穿过日面时几乎不削弱其亮度，异常厚时可遮蔽日轮轮廓</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="760.00" top="630.00" width="250.00" height="20.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="12" color="#1F2A33" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">纤维状或丝绢光泽，或两者兼有</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="760.00" top="654.00" width="250.00" height="46.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="10.5" color="#5A6B78" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">日出前/日落后常染亮黄或红色，比低云更早被照亮、更晚褪色；任何时刻近地平线的卷云常带黄色（低角度光路长）</Text></Container></Positioned>
